# Build context root for backend/Containerfile is this directory (platform/).
# The image only needs the crate (backend/) and its compile-time include_str!
# targets (goldens/). Ignore everything else so the context upload stays small
# and never carries secrets or the frontend tree.
#
# Read by both docker buildx (CI) and podman (VPS build-on-host fallback).
*
!backend
!goldens

# Re-exclude heavy or sensitive paths under the allowed directories.
backend/target
backend/.env
backend/.env.*
goldens/parity
**/*.tsbuildinfo
